-  "note": "Sky1 arm64 DEFAULT kernel under the unified 7.3 policy: r292 = the v7.3.0 FINAL pin, re-verified independently on 2026-10-21. The r290 series (consolidated port patch + 27 numbered patches 0001-0011 + 0013-0028) was replayed onto the upstream v7.3 tag (peel c03c1a14) in SRC_URI order: 28/28 applied, 0 conflicts, 0 rejects, 0 fuzz. (Replaying in FILENAME order instead reports 21 spurious conflicts.) NO patch is upstream: each of the 28 was tested by reverse-apply check, by apply-then-compare against pristine v7.3, and by the ordered replay -- 0/28 are no-ops, so nothing was dropped. No upstream clobbering: the two files the port patch shares with upstream's rc7..v7.3 changes (panthor_hw.c c347fef5f8f8; quirks.c 0f8b5d90d179, 7209846a169f) all survive in the merged tree. Tree-equivalence: the same series replayed on rc7 and on v7.3 gives trees differing in 212 files, every one of which upstream itself changed between the tags -- zero unexplained differences. An independent from-scratch replay diffs 0 files against the tree this build compiled. Built in the ncz-yocto-y6 container on ULTRA (aarch64-nclawzero-linux-gcc 15.3.0). 7.3.0-sky1-ncz is a NEW KVER, so all six accelerator overlays were rebuilt from this build's headers: verify-overlay-modversions PASS, 0 CRC mismatches, 0 unresolved. Gates re-run 2026-10-21: kvm-kernel-gate PASS (r292 vs r290 error histograms identical), dkms-abi-gate PASS, acceptance 28/28, 376 .ko with 0 .ko.xz. Debian debs built and byte-identical across two runs. STILL NOT DONE: no hardware boot (O6N/cixmini untouched), not published to apt. r292 = r291 + CIX patches-7.3 0029-0033 (same KVER 7.3.0-sky1-ncz, NOT ABI-compatible with r291: 0029 widens drm_crtc_state.plane_mask, 628 DRM symbol CRCs differ; overlays rebuilt).",
+  "note": "Sky1 arm64 DEFAULT kernel under the unified 7.3 policy: r298 = linux-stable v7.3.3 (the same 7.3.3 as amd64 7.3.3-r297) with the r295/r297 7.3.1 series unchanged. The 33 SRC_URI patches (consolidated port patch + 0001-0011 + 0013-0033) and the defconfig are byte-identical to the 7.3.1 recipe's. Replayed in SRC_URI order on pristine v7.3.3 with fuzz 0: 33/33 applied (31 clean, 2 with line offsets only, the same as on v7.3.1), 0 reverse-apply on pristine v7.3.3 (none upstreamed); replay(v7.3.1) plus upstream v7.3.1..v7.3.3 equals replay(v7.3.3) (tree e101a48b); the only shared file is arm-smmu-v3.c, where upstream 73a1e1bfe3db (shutdown) and 0032 (IRQ setup/resume) touch disjoint code. The built kernel-source equals that replay file for file. Built in ncz-yocto-y6 on ULTRA (aarch64-nclawzero-linux-gcc 15.3.0). New KVER, so all six accelerator overlays were rebuilt from this build: verify-overlay-modversions PASS, 0 CRC mismatches, 0 unresolved, this_module 0x500. Gates: kvm-kernel-gate PASS, qemu EFI boot PASS, dkms-abi-gate PASS, acceptance 42/42, 376 .ko with 0 compressed. Debian debs byte-identical across two runs. Boot-tested on O6N @O6N_BOOT_DATE@ (docs/O6N-TEST-PLAN-7.3.3.md). Not published to apt.",
